- package name/revision;
- exact C6 candidate identity;
- exact C6 archive/manifest/freeze receipt identities;
- exact independent PASS-verdict identity;
- exact effective prospective-boundary governance;
- exact repository baseline consumed;
- exact scope of proposed adoption;
- all authority ceilings;
- all historical non-promotions;
- activation prerequisites;
- publication prerequisites.

### B. Complete continuation checkpoint

