- independently reviewed integration package;
- exact accepted commit/tree identity;
- independent publication verification;
- remote equality;
- exact activation artifact/receipt;
- no unresolved substantive drift between reviewed adoption state and activation;
- durable-anchor availability;
- successor-control applicability preservation;
- preserved historical ledger.

Define the proposed effective-start boundary precisely.

Do not activate it in this lane.

